  "releaseNotes": "1. Added a .NET 11 target;\n2. In version for .NET 11 was added a new compressor (`ZstdCompressor`) based on the `System.IO.Compression.ZstandardStream` class;\n3. Three classes have been deprecated: `BuiltInBrotliCompressor` class replaced by the `BrotliCompressor` class, `BuiltInBrotliCompressionSettings` class replaced by the `BrotliCompressionSettings` class and `BuiltInBrotliCompressorFactory` class replaced by the `BrotliCompressorFactory` class.",
